<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Next Section</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://stackpath.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/4.3.1/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/confidence.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container text-center mt-4">
        <h1>Next Section</h1>
        <p class="lead"><strong>Congratulations on completing the practice questions!</strong></p>
        <p><em>Please pay close attention to the following instructions:</em></p>
        <div class="textContainer">
            <p><strong>In the next part of the activity, you will be asked to complete a series of question blocks, each consisting of twenty questions.<br><br> Each time, you will be presented with two options for the automated assitance you will receieve.  These choices will be labeled by their <u>source</u> and <u>size</u>.<br><br> One of the options utilizes recommendations generated by a <em>group of humans</em>, either medium or large. The other option utilizes recommendations generated through <em>machine learning</em>, with either medium or large amount of training data.<br><br> You will choose one of these options to assist you in the following round, and that decision will be permanenet for twenty image identification questions. You should use the provided assistance as needed to ensure your accuracy.</strong><br><br></p>
        </div>
        <p>Click the button below to proceed to the main portion of the activity.</p>
        <form action="/activity/{{ userID }}/buffer/next" method="post">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Proceed to Next Section</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
